# FAKE TLS AUTO — converted from Flowseal/zapret-discord-youtube 1.10.0, general (FAKE TLS AUTO).bat
#
# Generated by pkg/presetimport. Run VERBATIM: Lotsman composes nothing in
# preset mode, so these are the profiles the upstream author wrote, in order.
#
# Needs these lists on disk: ipset-all.txt, ipset-exclude.txt, list-exclude.txt, list-general.txt, list-google.txt
# Needs these payloads in the zapret files dir: ACTIVE_DISCORD_UDP.bin, quic_initial_www_google_com.bin, tls_clienthello_max_ru.bin
#
# CHANGED FROM UPSTREAM — everything else passed through untouched:
#   - dropped *-user.txt references (empty upstream; a missing hostlist makes nfqws exit)
#   - dropped --wf-* (WinDivert capture; ours is derived from --filter-* into nft)
#   - dropped profiles filtered only by %GameFilter*% (set by service.bat at runtime)

--filter-udp=443
--hostlist=/var/lib/lotsman-hostlists/flowseal/list-general.txt
--hostlist-exclude=/var/lib/lotsman-hostlists/flowseal/list-exclude.txt
